 * A numbered figure with a caption. Plots from reports sit on a white plate in both themes, since
 * they were drawn for a white page.
 *
 * File Structure:
 * - Props: figure name, alt text, number, plate
 * - Caption from the default slot
 *
 * Where this file is used within the repository:
 * - Project pages
